---
title: ServiceAgreement (MF-01)
---
stateDiagram-v2
  direction LR
  [*] --> DRAFT : HR prepares agreement version
  DRAFT --> SENT_TO_CLIENT : HR sends to Client
  SENT_TO_CLIENT --> CHANGE_REQUESTED : Client requests changes
  CHANGE_REQUESTED --> VOID : HR issues a new version
  SENT_TO_CLIENT --> ACCEPTED : Client accepts terms
  ACCEPTED --> AWAITING_SIGNATURE : primary contact requests signing OTP
  AWAITING_SIGNATURE --> SIGNED : correct OTP entered, PDF stored in R2
  AWAITING_SIGNATURE --> AWAITING_SIGNATURE : wrong / expired OTP, resend
  SENT_TO_CLIENT --> VOID : superseded or job rejected
  SIGNED --> [*]
  VOID --> [*]
